      "message": "There is a decision we will need to make: Should we use the internal API or the \"public\" API?\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/boringssl/src/crypto/fipsmodule/ec/p256.c;drc\u003d0e9a0b6e9bb6ec59521977eec805f5d0bca833e0;l\u003d474\n\nOr the public interface?\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/boringssl/src/include/openssl/ecdh.h;drc\u003d4732c544f76958ea75af2e5a05b9d77a2341128a;l\u003d88\n\nThe public interface would be more stable, although there are also no guarantees of API or ABI stability. https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl/\n\nBut the public API would require more code size, memory usage and dynamic memory allocation, and may potentially use more unsupported features.",
